### Monolith — internal only, not published on GitHub/Cloudflare Pages
# Both hosts currently serve the whole repo as static files (no build step),
# so anything kept out of git here also stays off the live domain.
docs/
tools/

# Case source assets (raw CAD/scan files) — only the small render/glb outputs
# in assets/cases/ ship to the site. Keep the attribution file, drop the rest.
assets/sources/*/*
!assets/sources/*/SOURCE.md